gymops.gateDoc:
ربط بوابة الدخول مع أرك

POST {{url}}
Headers: apikey + Content-Type: application/json
Body: {"gate_key": "{{key}}", "token": "<محتوى رمز QR أو الرقم>"}
الرد: allowed (true/false)، reason، first_name، days_left

Gate integration with ARQ: POST the scanned QR text (or 6-digit code) as "token" with the gate key; open when allowed = true.
